{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you pursue a missing student through the dark corridors of the abandoned Blackwood school, brace yourself for the terror of the secrets that await you and the entity watching from the shadows. Blackwood: Beneath the Silence offers a narrative-driven psychological horror experience where you will feel the suspense around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense exploration where light and sound guide your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles: keys, fuses, chalk markings, locked doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented storytelling via notes, tapes, and objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stalking entity that reacts to sight and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player choices shaping multiple endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror focused on exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and light survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic stalker AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u20136 hours, single player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/Subtitles: English and Turkish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content Warning</strong><br>Intense suspense, dark themes, jump scares, oppressive atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1758483748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1758483748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/e0a5cb64d989646325d41def9a73f8c513766cb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758483748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/e0a